      "content": "what do you mean by \"the Gobblers (or Goblins) of the dye industry\"? i'm not familiar with that term in textile manufacturing.\n\ncan you please ignore the \"goblin\" references and just finish the explanation regarding the mechanical factors? i specifically need to know if the 4 bar pressure is enough to ensure the heat distribution is even enough for those high-polyester blends, or if the pressure is likely failing to force the dye into the fibers.",
