      "content": "thanks. i'll try increasing the pressure to 5.5 bar. \n\nyou were saying that the dwell time needs to be sufficient for the dye to diffuse into the polymer. could you finish that thought? also, if we increase the pressure, does that mean we can decrease the dwell time, or are they independent variables in this setup?",
